{"day": 8, "followers": {"instagram": 10, "tiktok": 63, "youtube": 32}, "interim": false, "likes": {"instagram": 61, "tiktok": 94, "youtube": 106}, "rent": {"amount": 900, "dueDay": 30}, "story": [{"date": "20 Nov", "day": 1, "text": "Joe has $0, an empty fridge and $900 rent due in 30 days. You get to decide how he survives.", "title": "Joe has $0", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wvdVFkNSwFc"}, {"date": "21 Nov", "day": 2, "text": "You voted for $900 and a new son. No free money, but neighbor Mrs. Rivera needed a babysitter: Joe played baseball with her son Leo and earned $40.", "title": "Joe has a son?!", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1LzX9iBu5BU"}, {"date": "22 Nov", "day": 3, "text": "You voted C: both jobs. Then Leo vanished in the park for 10 minutes (ice cream truck). Night shift at the burger place, 3 AM sleep roll: 3, awake. Mrs. Rivera still doesn't know.", "title": "I lost Leo", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JFuBKFZ-ANI"}, {"date": "23 Nov", "day": 4, "event": {"label": "FIRED", "type": "bad"}, "text": "You voted A: Joe told Mrs. Rivera the truth. The real die rolled a 2: fired. Leo slipped him a note, a drawing of the man from apartment 4B. At midnight, that man knocked: \"I have an offer.\"", "title": "Someone knocked", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5lz4iBMhKb0"}, {"date": "24 Nov", "day": 5, "text": "You voted A: Joe opened the door. The man from 4B is Mr. Novak, 71, who sells old radios and cameras online. His offer: carry 20 boxes on Saturday for $80. One rule: never open the small blue box.", "title": "Never open the blue box", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Bplf7bM2i4"}, {"date": "25 Nov", "day": 6, "event": {"label": "FIRED", "type": "bad"}, "text": "You on TikTok said: take the deal, open the box, make cookies. Joe left cookies for Leo, then lifted the blue lid while Mr. Novak stepped out: one envelope, one word on it, LEO. The die rolled a 1: caught. \"I said always. Get out.\" Minutes later his boss texted: \"Don't come back. You're fired.\" No job, no income.", "title": "He opened the box. Then he got fired.", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MIQ7wjXPMj0"}, {"date": "26 Nov", "day": 7, "event": {"label": "ROLLED A 6", "type": "good"}, "text": "You voted A: Joe told Mr. Novak everything. The real die (1–3 = door stays shut) rolled a 6: \"You came back to tell me. Saturday stands.\" The $80 job is back on. First answer: Leo visits Novak every week, Novak teaches him to draw. That's how Leo drew him. But: \"Don't tell Leo about the envelope. Not yet.\"", "title": "He confessed. Saturday stands.", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UAWwCncM-Bg"}, {"date": "27 Nov", "day": 8, "text": "Nobody voted, so Joe chose himself: he told Leo about the envelope. The real die (1–2 = no Saturday job) rolled a 5: Saturday stands. Then Leo whispered: \"That's how my grandpa wrote my name.\" Answer #2: the letter is from Leo's grandpa.", "title": "A letter from Leo's grandpa", "video": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4XmaYsmVfVc"}, {"date": "28 Nov", "day": 9, "text": "Drops at 7 PM CET with the result of your vote.", "upcoming": true}], "tx": [{"amt": 0, "kind": "open", "sub": "Day 1 · Joe starts with nothing", "t": "2026-11-20T19:00:00+01:00", "title": "Account opened"}, {"amt": 55, "kind": "follow", "n": 11, "platform": "youtube", "rate": 5, "t": "2026-11-21T06:00:00+01:00"}, {"amt": 4.5, "kind": "like", "n": 18, "platform": "youtube", "t": "2026-11-21T06:00:00+01:00"}, {"amt": 5, "kind": "follow", "n": 1, "platform": "tiktok", "rate": 5, "t": "2026-11-21T06:00:00+01:00"}, {"amt": 0.5, "kind": "like", "n": 2, "platform": "tiktok", "t": "2026-11-21T06:00:00+01:00"}, {"amt": 0.75, "kind": "like", "n": 3, "platform": "instagram", "t": "2026-11-21T06:00:00+01:00"}, {"amt": -5, "kind": "unfollow", "n": 1, "platform": "youtube", "t": "2026-11-21T07:25:00+01:00"}, {"amt": 5, "kind": "follow", "n": 1, "platform": "instagram", "rate": 5, "t": "2026-11-21T0